title: "GovGridMARL: Governance-Aware Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning for Residential Smart-Grid Demand Response"
abstract: >-
  A constrained multi-agent reinforcement learning framework for residential
  smart-grid demand response that integrates fairness, safety, federated
  privacy, explainability, and runtime governance aligned with the EU AI Act.
